## What this app carries

Each package below is in this app. Its licence is in the folder of its name, next to this file, with the Homebrew formula it was built by where it has one. Its source is at the address given, at the version or commit given.

You may replace any of these libraries with your own build of it. They are in `Contents/Resources/lib`. Sign the app again afterwards, or MacOS will not run it:

    codesign --force --deep --sign - @NAME@.app

